cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ChipQC Guardian, cite this software and the separate source dataset and paper."
title: "ChipQC Guardian: Human-reviewed OoC brightfield image quality control"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "ChipQC Guardian contributors"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research prototype for grouped, calibrated, human-reviewed quality control
  of organ-on-a-chip brightfield images. Source data are separately cited and
  are not covered by this software license.
keywords:
  - organ-on-a-chip
  - brightfield microscopy
  - quality control
  - selective classification
  - human review
